'''Kuu''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.6 Update|Version 2.2.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] increases health, attack power, range, attack rate and grants [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

